              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩnĩmatambũũkĩsye andũ ang’endu moko makwa mũthenya mũima, ala maendaa mũendelenĩ ũte mũseo, makĩatĩĩa mosũanĩo moo ene; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "andũ ala manthatasya ũthyũnĩ wakwa mavinda onthe, makĩthemba mĩũndanĩ, na kũtoeeesya ũvani ĩũlũ wa mavali; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.3"
            ]
          }
        },
