        {
          "text": "ngamũtw’ĩĩa inyw’ĩ kũawa na ũvyũ, na inyw’onthe mũkakunama mũawe; nĩkwĩthĩwa yĩla neetanie, mũtyaaĩtĩka; yĩla naneenie, mũtyaaĩw’a; ĩndĩ nĩmweekie ũla nonaa wĩ ũthũku, na mwanyuva ũla ndaatanĩa. ",
